title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#10077
description: Fixed toolbar buttons in modals showing neither icons nor text
release: 5.5.0
tags: $:/tags/ChangeNote
change-type: bugfix
change-category: usability
github-links: https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/pull/10077
github-contributors: Davien21
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A modal is rendered outside of the page template, so `tv-config-toolbar-icons`, `tv-config-toolbar-text` and `tv-config-toolbar-class` were undefined inside it. Modals now take them from the widget that sent `tm-modal`.
